h a nerdy  responsible team Drake has a little  sister named Megan who makes their lives  miserable but it always had us up in our  feels it was a great show about blended  families and it was so relatable but  then it ended after just four seasons  and we totally miss it where is Drake  Bell now well he's still doing some  acting he's especially done a lot of  voice acting playing roles like  spider-man  he's also directed and starred in  several short films his next film is  called - the adventures of bunny Bravo  he's released a few albums and his last  EP came out in 2017 he also owns his own  indie  your label we're glad he is still acting  and singing but it's just not the same  without his crazy adventures on Hilary  Duff in Lizzie McGuire  before there was Hannah Montana Disney  Channel had another blonde teenage star  Lizzie McGuire was a super popular show  that started back in 2001 Lizzie McGuire  was really just a normal teenage girl  she wasn't the most popular kid at  school but she wasn't a nerd either she  had two best friends Miranda and Gordo  and she had a huge crush on the popular  Ethan craft the show was all about her  life which was so relatable but there  was one twist Lizzie McGuire had an  animated version of herself  this tiny animated Lizzie would pop up  on the screen and say what the real  Lizzie was thinking she was sarcastic  and hilarious we really missed the super  realistic portrayal of middle school  life - Lizzie was played by Hilary Duff  she was a huge teenage star in the early  2000s she was in the rom-com a  cinderella story and the Lizzie McGuire  Movie after she stopped acting on the  show she did several small roles like a  bunch of other Disney stars she also  focused on her musical career she  released five studio albums she  disappeared from the limelight for a  while and started a family she also  started a clothing line it would be so  cool to get a follow up show about  Lizzie being a mom or something just  like Raven did Hilary Duff will always  be Lizzie McGuire to us Selena Gomez in  Wizards of Waverly Place in 2007 Disney  Channel aired the first episode of one  of their most popular shows ever Wizards  of Waverly Place was one of the few  Disney Channel shows to run longer than  three seasons it was all about a normal  family that owned a restaurant but they  were a magical family only one of the  three kids can be a wizard forever they  all get magic training and have to  compete to be the family wizard it was  such a funny show and it always made us  want to be magical the middle child in  the show was Alex she was played by none  other than Selena Gomez selena has acted  some after the show ended but she really  focused on her musical career and she is  a hit pop star she has made it on to the  top 10 billboard lists not once but  seven times as of 2017 she has sold 7  million albums and  twenty-two million singles worldwide she  is just one talented actress we really  wish she was on our TVs every week with  the other wizards but we are glad she is  returning to acting Selena has at least  three movies coming up in the next  couple of years  stay tuned to find out which other pop  star we really wish was still on TV Shia  LaBeouf in even Stephens this next actor  might be one of the most successful  Disney Channel stars ever way back at  the turn of the century Disney Channel  had a show called even Stephens  the Stephens were a normal family from  California but Lewis is the youngest and  he has trouble fitting in his siblings  are basically perfect in his eyes and he  just isn't so he goes to great and  hilarious lengths to stand out the  oldest Stephens kid is a sports legend  who was super popular at school the  middle child is smart and always makes  perfect grades Lewis is goofy and  mischievous he's always up to something  it was because of even Stephens that  Shia LaBeouf got his big break he went  on to star in a ton of movies he was the  star of the Transform